    "ui.device_note": "The first transfer asks which port the talker is and remembers it - after that a press goes straight through. Here you can choose a different one, after a change of cable or device. The talker has to be awake for it: only a key press brings it out of sleep.",
    "ui.device_connect": "Choose the device",
