    "ui.device_section": "Device",
    "ui.build_note": "The files the talker reads - pictures, sounds and the table that ties them to keys. They normally go there over the cable, and then this is not needed. Written into a folder they are what tools/serialcheck.html can send and what mklittlefs turns into an image for esptool: the way in that stays open when something about the cable is wrong.",
