    "ui.data_note": "vorlaut lives entirely in this browser. Clearing its storage takes the board with it. A backup holds the board, your own pictures and the ARASAAC ones — no METACOM pictures and no Azure key.",
    "ui.data_notice": "This file holds the board, your own pictures and the ARASAAC ones, and a few settings. It does not hold METACOM pictures or the path to your METACOM folder — METACOM is licensed per person. An Azure key is not in it either. Both must be reconnected after restoring.",
